    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.3/5</span><span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span></div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Scaleway is a French cloud provider owned by the Iliad Group, best known today as a European sovereign-cloud alternative to US hyperscalers. It offers two relevant VPS paths: monthly-billed Dedibox VPS plans with unlimited traffic across 20+ worldwide locations, and hourly-billed Public Cloud Instances with zero egress fees in Paris, Amsterdam, and Warsaw.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Best value: VPS-PRO-2-M at €17.49/mo (4 vCPU, 8 GB, 125 GB NVMe, 500 Mbps premium CPU)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2><ul class="space-y-2">
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ European sovereign cloud — French provider, Iliad Group, EU regions</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Unlimited traffic on Dedibox VPS (fair-use throttling, not metered billing)</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Public Cloud Instances advertise zero egress fees</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 20+ VPS locations worldwide with same price and specs everywhere</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Three ranges: START (budget), PRO (premium CPU), STORE (high-capacity NVMe, 10 Gbit/s)</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Monthly billing with no hidden fees; full root access</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Strong developer ecosystem: API, CLI, Terraform, VPC/Private Network</li>
      </ul></div>
      <div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2><ul class="space-y-2">
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Dedibox VPS is a standalone product — not compatible with Dedibox dedicated extras (RPN, Failover IPs, Dedibackup)</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ START range uses standard CPUs; premium performance costs more (PRO/STORE)</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Fair-use traffic is throttled, not strictly unlimited for heavy bandwidth</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Support is solid but not the most hands-on on entry tiers</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Unmanaged — you handle the OS, updates, and security</li>
      </ul></div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8 mb-8"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Scaleway Dedibox VPS Pricing (verified 2026-08)</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-gray-700 text-gray-400"><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">Plan</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">vCPU</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">RAM</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">Storage</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">Bandwidth</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">Price</th></tr></thead><tbody>
